§§ `The limits of the items that say only: A.1(11), A.1(12), B.1(14)`

-- The three items are limited by a fact of the act; every other item carries no limit, so it stays within its limit whatever the facts say.
`facts with neither limit satisfied` MEANS `Facts about an act for the limits of First Schedule items` WITH
    `the parts connected are integral control and monitoring accessories only` IS FALSE
    `the electrical work is done in the integral electrical system only` IS FALSE

`facts with the accessories limit satisfied` MEANS `Facts about an act for the limits of First Schedule items` WITH
    `the parts connected are integral control and monitoring accessories only` IS TRUE
    `the electrical work is done in the integral electrical system only` IS FALSE

`facts with the electrical limit satisfied` MEANS `Facts about an act for the limits of First Schedule items` WITH
    `the parts connected are integral control and monitoring accessories only` IS FALSE
    `the electrical work is done in the integral electrical system only` IS TRUE

`facts with both limits satisfied` MEANS `Facts about an act for the limits of First Schedule items` WITH
    `the parts connected are integral control and monitoring accessories only` IS TRUE
    `the electrical work is done in the integral electrical system only` IS TRUE

#ASSERT NOT `the act stays within the limits of the First Schedule item` `A.1(11) connecting integral control and monitoring accessories only` `facts with neither limit satisfied`
#ASSERT `the act stays within the limits of the First Schedule item` `A.1(11) connecting integral control and monitoring accessories only` `facts with the accessories limit satisfied`
#ASSERT NOT `the act stays within the limits of the First Schedule item` `A.1(11) connecting integral control and monitoring accessories only` `facts with the electrical limit satisfied`
#ASSERT `the act stays within the limits of the First Schedule item` `A.1(11) connecting integral control and monitoring accessories only` `facts with both limits satisfied`
#ASSERT NOT `the act stays within the limits of the First Schedule item` `A.1(12) electrical work in the integral electrical system only` `facts with neither limit satisfied`
#ASSERT NOT `the act stays within the limits of the First Schedule item` `A.1(12) electrical work in the integral electrical system only` `facts with the accessories limit satisfied`
#ASSERT `the act stays within the limits of the First Schedule item` `A.1(12) electrical work in the integral electrical system only` `facts with the electrical limit satisfied`
