§§ `Defined terms that limit an item: integral control and monitoring accessories`

`a fixed sensor that only monitors` MEANS `Facts about a part accompanying a system under the First Schedule` WITH
    `permanently connected to the system` IS TRUE
    `used to monitor the function of the installation` IS TRUE
    `used to warn of the function of the installation` IS FALSE
    `used to control the function of the installation` IS FALSE

`a fixed alarm that only warns` MEANS `Facts about a part accompanying a system under the First Schedule` WITH
    `permanently connected to the system` IS TRUE
    `used to monitor the function of the installation` IS FALSE
    `used to warn of the function of the installation` IS TRUE
    `used to control the function of the installation` IS FALSE

`a fixed controller that only controls` MEANS `Facts about a part accompanying a system under the First Schedule` WITH
    `permanently connected to the system` IS TRUE
    `used to monitor the function of the installation` IS FALSE
    `used to warn of the function of the installation` IS FALSE
    `used to control the function of the installation` IS TRUE

`a fixed part that monitors, warns and controls` MEANS `Facts about a part accompanying a system under the First Schedule` WITH
    `permanently connected to the system` IS TRUE
    `used to monitor the function of the installation` IS TRUE
    `used to warn of the function of the installation` IS TRUE
    `used to control the function of the installation` IS TRUE

`a fixed part that serves no listed function` MEANS `Facts about a part accompanying a system under the First Schedule` WITH
    `permanently connected to the system` IS TRUE
    `used to monitor the function of the installation` IS FALSE
    `used to warn of the function of the installation` IS FALSE
    `used to control the function of the installation` IS FALSE

`a loose part that monitors, warns and controls` MEANS `Facts about a part accompanying a system under the First Schedule` WITH
    `permanently connected to the system` IS FALSE
    `used to monitor the function of the installation` IS TRUE
    `used to warn of the function of the installation` IS TRUE
    `used to control the function of the installation` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `the part is an integral control and monitoring accessory` `a fixed sensor that only monitors`
#ASSERT `the part is an integral control and monitoring accessory` `a fixed alarm that only warns`
#ASSERT `the part is an integral control and monitoring accessory` `a fixed controller that only controls`
#ASSERT `the part is an integral control and monitoring accessory` `a fixed part that monitors, warns and controls`
#ASSERT NOT `the part is an integral control and monitoring accessory` `a fixed part that serves no listed function`
#ASSERT NOT `the part is an integral control and monitoring accessory` `a loose part that monitors, warns and controls`
-- The reading that the three functions must all be served.
#ASSERT NOT `the part is an integral control and monitoring accessory, serving all three functions` `a fixed sensor that only monitors`
#ASSERT NOT `the part is an integral control and monitoring accessory, serving all three functions` `a fixed alarm that only warns`
#ASSERT NOT `the part is an integral control and monitoring accessory, serving all three functions` `a fixed controller that only controls`
#ASSERT `the part is an integral control and monitoring accessory, serving all three functions` `a fixed part that monitors, warns and controls`
#ASSERT NOT `the part is an integral control and monitoring accessory, serving all three functions` `a loose part that monitors, warns and controls`

§§ `Defined terms that limit an item: the integral electrical system (trap T10: the items spell the word with an extra letter)`

`a panel supplied by the manufacturer` MEANS `Facts about an electrical system of a cooling system under the First Schedule` WITH
    `a dedicated system forming part of the cooling system` IS TRUE
    `part of the dedicated panel of the cooling system` IS TRUE
    `supplied by the manufacturer` IS TRUE
    `supplied to the requirements of the manufacturer` IS FALSE
    `intended for the cooling system` IS FALSE

`a panel supplied to the manufacturer's requirements` MEANS `Facts about an electrical system of a cooling system under the First Schedule` WITH
    `a dedicated system forming part of the cooling system` IS TRUE
    `part of the dedicated panel of the cooling system` IS TRUE
    `supplied by the manufacturer` IS FALSE
    `supplied to the requirements of the manufacturer` IS TRUE
    `intended for the cooling system` IS FALSE

`a panel intended for the cooling system` MEANS `Facts about an electrical system of a cooling system under the First Schedule` WITH
    `a dedicated system forming part of the cooling system` IS TRUE
    `part of the dedicated panel of the cooling system` IS TRUE
    `supplied by the manufacturer` IS FALSE
    `supplied to the requirements of the manufacturer` IS FALSE
    `intended for the cooling system` IS TRUE

`a panel with no provenance` MEANS `Facts about an electrical system of a cooling system under the First Schedule` WITH
    `a dedicated system forming part of the cooling system` IS TRUE
    `part of the dedicated panel of the cooling system` IS TRUE
    `supplied by the manufacturer` IS FALSE
    `supplied to the requirements of the manufacturer` IS FALSE
    `intended for the cooling system` IS FALSE

`a dedicated system that is not part of the panel` MEANS `Facts about an electrical system of a cooling system under the First Schedule` WITH
    `a dedicated system forming part of the cooling system` IS TRUE
    `part of the dedicated panel of the cooling system` IS FALSE
    `supplied by the manufacturer` IS TRUE
    `supplied to the requirements of the manufacturer` IS TRUE
    `intended for the cooling system` IS TRUE

`a system that is not dedicated` MEANS `Facts about an electrical system of a cooling system under the First Schedule` WITH
    `a dedicated system forming part of the cooling system` IS FALSE
    `part of the dedicated panel of the cooling system` IS TRUE
    `supplied by the manufacturer` IS TRUE
    `supplied to the requirements of the manufacturer` IS TRUE
    `intended for the cooling system` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `the electrical system is the integral electrical system of the cooling system` `a panel supplied by the manufacturer`
#ASSERT `the electrical system is the integral electrical system of the cooling system` `a panel supplied to the manufacturer's requirements`
#ASSERT `the electrical system is the integral electrical system of the cooling system` `a panel intended for the cooling system`
#ASSERT NOT `the electrical system is the integral electrical system of the cooling system` `a panel with no provenance`
#ASSERT NOT `the electrical system is the integral electrical system of the cooling system` `a dedicated system that is not part of the panel`
#ASSERT NOT `the electrical system is the integral electrical system of the cooling system` `a system that is not dedicated`
-- The reading that the parenthesis only illustrates: a dedicated system that is part of a cooling system is enough.
#ASSERT `the electrical system is the integral electrical system of the cooling system, the parenthesis read as an illustration` `a panel with no provenance`
#ASSERT `the electrical system is the integral electrical system of the cooling system, the parenthesis read as an illustration` `a dedicated system that is not part of the panel`
#ASSERT NOT `the electrical system is the integral electrical system of the cooling system, the parenthesis read as an illustration` `a system that is not dedicated`

§§ `Trap T8: the oil item is installation work for grade 1 and maintenance work for grade 3 only`

-- A.1(5) lists oil work done while installing, under all three kinds; B.3(3) lists oil work done on maintenance under grade 3 only.
#ASSERT elem `grade 1 licence` (`licence kinds that may do the activity` `A.1(5) refrigerant and oil handling during installation`)
#ASSERT NOT elem `grade 1 licence` (`licence kinds that may do the activity` `B.3(3) adding or replacing oil during maintenance`)
#ASSERT NOT elem `grade 2 licence` (`licence kinds that may do the activity` `B.3(3) adding or replacing oil during maintenance`)
#ASSERT elem `grade 3 licence` (`licence kinds that may do the activity` `B.3(3) adding or replacing oil during maintenance`)

§§ `Trap T9: B.1(3) and B.3(2) both reach components; B.3(2) is grade 3 only`

#ASSERT elem `grade 1 licence` (`licence kinds that may do the activity` `B.1(3) checking or repairing mechanical and electrical components of the system`)
#ASSERT NOT elem `grade 1 licence` (`licence kinds that may do the activity` `B.3(2) treating a refrigerant system and its components`)
#ASSERT NOT elem `grade 2 licence` (`licence kinds that may do the activity` `B.3(2) treating a refrigerant system and its components`)

-- An act that two items describe: the existential reading lists a kind listed under at least one of them, the universal reading a kind listed under all of them.
#ASSERT `licence kinds that may do an act described by any of the activities` (LIST `B.1(3) checking or repairing mechanical and electrical components of the system`, `B.3(2) treating a refrigerant system and its components`) EQUALS (LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that may do an act described by all of the activities` (LIST `B.1(3) checking or repairing mechanical and electrical components of the system`, `B.3(2) treating a refrigerant system and its components`) EQUALS (LIST `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that may do an act described by any of the activities` (LIST `A.1(5) refrigerant and oil handling during installation`, `B.3(3) adding or replacing oil during maintenance`) EQUALS (LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that may do an act described by all of the activities` (LIST `A.1(5) refrigerant and oil handling during installation`, `B.3(3) adding or replacing oil during maintenance`) EQUALS (LIST `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that may do an act described by any of the activities` (LIST `B.1(3) checking or repairing mechanical and electrical components of the system`) EQUALS (LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that may do an act described by all of the activities` (LIST `B.1(3) checking or repairing mechanical and electrical components of the system`) EQUALS (LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that may do an act described by any of the activities` (LIST `B.3(2) treating a refrigerant system and its components`, `B.3(3) adding or replacing oil during maintenance`) EQUALS (LIST `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that may do an act described by any of the activities` EMPTY EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `licence kinds that may do an act described by all of the activities` EMPTY EQUALS EMPTY

